[sliver] These are the ends of the two integral 0.8 mm PET-GF snap tabs. Each is 8 mm wide, 9 mm long and rooted to the 2.4 mm plate with a 0.6 mm inner fillet. The tabs print upright above the artwork-down face. The native slice contains both complete 0.8 mm stems; these are intentional flexures, not loose wall fragments.
